    [
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "卷烟零售经营指南"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                388,
                34,
                608,
                55
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "一、开店准备"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                47,
                79,
                186,
                98
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1. 选址：选择人流量较大的商业区域，注意与学校保持规定距离。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                48,
                108,
                586,
                124
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2. 办证：取得营业执照后，向当地烟草专卖局申请烟草专卖零售许可证。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                47,
                135,
                642,
                151
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3. 进货：通过当地烟草公司正规渠道进货，不得从非法渠道采购。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                47,
                161,
                586,
                178
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "二、日常经营要点"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                48,
                204,
                230,
                223
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1. 明码标价：所有卷烟必须明码标价，不得哄抬价格或低价倾销。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                48,
                231,
                584,
                249
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2. 真烟销售：严禁销售假冒伪劣卷烟，发现假烟应立即举报。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                47,
                259,
                549,
                275
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3. 限量供应：部分紧俏品牌实行限量供应，应合理分配给客户。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                47,
                286,
                568,
                303
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "三、法律法规须知"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                48,
                329,
                230,
                347
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1. 禁止向未成年人销售卷烟。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                48,
                357,
                290,
                374
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2. 不得在大众传播媒介发布烟草广告。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                47,
                384,
                364,
                400
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3. 烟草专卖许可证不得涂改、伪造、转让。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                47,
                411,
                401,
                426
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "4. 跨地域携带卷烟不得超过50条。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                47,
                438,
                329,
                454
            ]
        }
    ]
]